{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"85548","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/85548","key":"MC-270871","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"17/Apr/24 11:13 AM","customfield_10050":"1223850","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>Summary:</b><br>\nRelates to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-270767\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-270767\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Leather horse armor no longer prevents horses from freezing in powder snow\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-270767\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n. In 24w05a the way that horse armor is stored on horses was changed to use body_armor_item instead of ArmorItems<span class=\"error\">[2]</span>. However when upgrading a world, the horse armor is not removed from ArmorItems<span class=\"error\">[2]</span> but it is added to body_armor_item as expected. This causes duplicated horse armor storage. This means that the horse will behave as if it is still wearing the horse armor even when you remove it, causing enchantments to be applied when they shouldn't and allowing you to not experience \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-268934\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-268934\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"The depth strider and respiration enchantments no longer function on horse armor\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-268934\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n, \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-270539\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-270539\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"The blast protection enchantment, when applied to horse armor, no longer diminishes the knockback effect from explosions on horse\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-270539\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n, \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-270301\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-270301\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"The fire protection enchantment applied to horse armor no longer decreases the duration of time the horse remains ablaze\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-270301\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n. While the issue for enchantments doesn't affect survival gameplay, this issue causes the horse to still be immune to freezing even if it is no longer wearing leather horse armor.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b><br>\nYou can use the world download <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110941\" title=\"MC-270871.zip attached to MC-270871\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"MC-270871.zip\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"34757e80-6921-449a-9aa3-c75b58949aa5\" rel=\"noreferrer\">MC-270871.zip<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> to skip to step 5.</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Start version 1.20.4.</li>\n\t<li>Tame a horse.</li>\n\t<li>Saddle it and equip it with leather horse armor.</li>\n\t<li>Upgrade the world to the latest version.</li>\n\t<li>Unequip the leather horse armor from the horse.</li>\n\t<li>Ride the horse into powder snow.</li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/execute on vehicle run data get entity @s</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Observed results:</b><br>\nThe horse won't freeze in the powder snow even though it is no longer wearing the leather horse armor.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected results:</b><br>\nThe horse should freeze, since it is not wearing leather horse armor anymore</p>\n\n<p>Note: Fixing this by removing the ArmorItems array from horses entirely wouldn't be a good idea, since that will break things made by map makers. All mobs seem to have an ArmorItems array. The best way to fix this is probably by removing items from ArmorItems<span class=\"error\">[2]</span> on horses when upgrading the world to prevent duplicated horse armor storage.</p>\n\n<p><b>Screenshots:</b><br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"110940_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110940\" title=\"image-2024-04-17-21-04-45-510.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"110940\" file-preview-title=\"image-2024-04-17-21-04-45-510.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110940?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110940\" filename=\"image-2024-04-17-21-04-45-510.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110940\" data-attachment-name=\"image-2024-04-17-21-04-45-510.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"f880d49e-dded-408d-bd96-664a3a2c04d9\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Apr/24 9:49 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/110940","id":"110940","filename":"image-2024-04-17-21-04-45-510.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] EVGENSYPERPRO","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"17/Apr/24 11:04 AM","size":"813 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110940","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110940"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/110941","id":"110941","filename":"MC-270871.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:e30e